ng lunch. but you know what sucked have a vectors test right after LUNCH it was about dot products and other products. I think i might have failed. hopefully not. then something fun happened. Robotics because you dont actually have any classes in robotics because its not supposed to have any  classes and just be fun and for experiences WAIT alex said something. He said it only has java classes which I find quite funny. That was an epic joke which I liked a lot I might use this later on in the future. We also made super descriptive variable name and now i am typing all this. Goodbye - Tallon, Hamad, Alex (Ryder Not Here)", "created_at": "2024-03-06T23:27:30Z", "repo": "Team5870-2024", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8930c7b310776d0ffa998625254c5ba36a3ddaa4", "message": "Merge branch 'SwerveV2-Works' of https://github.com/NotBip/Team5870-2024 into SwerveV2-Works", "created_at": "2024-03-06T22:01:56Z", "repo": "Team5870-2024", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0185bcd7b0c24496407d2ee154bbcefbbdcb7bbc", "message": "Merge branch 'SwerveV2-Works' of https://github.com/NotBip/Team5870-2024 into SwerveV2-Works", "created_at": "2024-03-06T22:01:39Z", "repo": "Team5870-2024", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4764e6469e35fc586418e7d37fc10606a3adfdd8", "message": "this thing sucks", "created_at": "2024-03-06T22:00:46Z", "repo": "Team5870-2024", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dbade602b487b1df3173b692cec6c647ec59e0f2", "message": "Changed a method name", "created_at": "2024-03-06T03:42:14Z", "repo": "Team5870-2024", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "417f61476f8c90fb52e9bba423890720f8cb1c18", "message": "Added timeout to intake spin back", "created_at": "2024-03-05T14:11:42Z", "repo": "Team5870-2024", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_im